# Local study-material corpora and access docs — source PDFs, not app code.
#
# Textbooks are hosted objects, not repository contents: they go to the R2 bucket through
# Admin -> Materials and reach students as byte ranges. A book checked in here would also be
# a book anyone with repository access could take whole, which is the one thing the reader
# exists to prevent. They are big enough to matter too — a 181 MB atlas is past GitHub's
# 100 MB file limit, so committing one does not fail at review, it fails at push, after the
# commit already exists.
*.pdf
